{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "21", "x": 0.9086877902929988, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.025055458310636873, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "READING PASSAGE 3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15144386551327726, "w": 0.2551216853297966, "h": 0.02039118517446672, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "You should spend about 20 minutes on Question 27 – 40, which are based on", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1732478865835418, "w": 0.8270737491724954, "h": 0.02039118517446672, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "How stress affects our judgement", "x": 0.2727608729507697, "y": 0.21724892905194523, "w": 0.4971913801529939, "h": 0.026142565890596797, "c": 1, "size": 18.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Some of the most important decisions of our lives occur while we're feeling", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.256540644272331, "w": 0.826099044436673, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "stressed and anxious. From medical decisions to financial and professional ones,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.28490811219669926, "w": 0.8261203696270645, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "we are all sometimes required to weigh up information under stressful conditions.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3132384622708369, "w": 0.8260771040965588, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "But do we become better or worse at processing and using information under such", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.34156879348427827, "w": 0.8261856780226381, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "circumstances?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3697508984858482, "w": 0.16533171487441256, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "My colleague and I, both neuroscientists, wanted to investigate how the mind", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39808124855998583, "w": 0.825961455948667, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "operates under stress, so we visited some local fire stations. Firefighters'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4264115986341235, "w": 0.8259247520152049, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "workdays vary quite a bit. Some are pretty relaxed; they'll spend their time", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4547419864296536, "w": 0.826077001571605, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "washing the truck, cleaning equipment, cooking meals and reading. Other days", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48309708173727833, "w": 0.8263439765513128, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "can be hectic, with numerous life-threatening incidents to attend to; they'll enter", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5114274318114159, "w": 0.8262958923479783, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "burning homes to rescue trapped residents, and assist with medical emergencies.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5397578196069461, "w": 0.8262076183627524, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "These ups and downs presented the perfect setting for an experiment on how", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5680881696810838, "w": 0.8265680961003301, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people's ability to use information changes when they feel under pressure.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5964185574766139, "w": 0.7613137311773156, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "We found that perceived threat acted as a trigger for a stress reaction that made", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.624748945272144, "w": 0.8261643528322468, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the task of processing information easier for the firefighters - but only as long as", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6530792953462816, "w": 0.8267239340301135, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it conveyed bad news.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6814467632706499, "w": 0.22867580922689726, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This is how we arrived at these results. We asked the firefighters to estimate their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7097771133447875, "w": 0.8262295587028666, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "likelihood of experiencing 40 different adverse events in their life, such as being", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7381074634189252, "w": 0.82599036798564, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "involved in an accident or becoming a victim of card fraud. We then gave them", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7664378889358479, "w": 0.8264801296899655, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "either good news (that their likelihood of experiencing these events was lower", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7947682390099855, "w": 0.8260117957009852, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "than they'd thought) or bad news (that it was higher) and asked them to provide", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.823098589084123, "w": 0.8266682629801974, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "new estimates.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8512806940856931, "w": 0.15767197305070074, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "People are normally quite optimistic - they will ignore bad news and embrace the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8796357139505327, "w": 0.8265648153018084, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "good. This is what happened when the firefighters were relaxed; but when they", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9079661394674554, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "were under stress, a different pattern emerged. Under these conditions, they", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9362964895415931, "w": 0.8258376058044707, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}